# Optional, local-dev only.
# FinWise AI is designed so each VISITOR enters their own OpenAI API key
# directly in the app's sidebar at runtime -- this .env value is only a
# convenience default that pre-fills that box during local development.
# Never commit a real key. Copy this file to .env and fill in a value
# only if you want a local default.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
